flowchart TD
    subgraph Client
        A[Developer Laptop] -->|git push| B[(GitHub Repository)]
        C[Browser] -->|HTTP GET :80| D
    end

    subgraph Server[Linux Server - Ubuntu 22.04/24.04]
        D[Nginx Web Server]
        D -->|serves static files| W[Web Root /var/www/hello-web]
        D -->|proxy_pass /api| B1[Backend 127.0.0.1:3000]

        subgraph Systemd
            SVC[hello-web.service]
            B1 -->|managed by| SVC
        end

        subgraph Firewall[ufw firewall]
            F[allow OpenSSH 22<br/>allow Nginx Full 80/443<br/>deny everything else]
        end

        subgraph Logs
            L1[nginx access/error logs<br/>/var/log/nginx/]
            L2[journalctl -u nginx / hello-web]
        end
    end

    B -->|git clone / git pull| D
    C -->|http://SERVER_IP| D
    D -->|writes| L1
    SVC -->|writes| L2
    F -.protects.-> Server
